@startuml
actor Utilisateur
participant "Angular" as Front
participant "ClientController" as Controller
participant "ClientServiceImpl" as Service
participant "AuthorizationService" as Authz
participant "ClientRepository" as Repo
participant "ClientMapper" as Mapper
database "MySQL" as DB

Utilisateur -> Front : Demande de création ou de liste des clients
Front -> Controller : GET /api/clients ou POST /api/clients
Controller -> Service : create(dto) / findAll()
Service -> Authz : assertAdmin() / currentUser()
Authz --> Service : autorisation validée
Service -> Repo : existsByEmail(email) / findAll()
Repo -> DB : SELECT / COUNT
DB --> Repo : données clients
Repo --> Service : clients / résultat
Service -> Mapper : toEntity(dto) / toResponse(client)
Mapper --> Service : objet DTO
Service --> Controller : ClientResponseDTO / List<ClientResponseDTO>
Controller --> Front : HTTP 200/201 + JSON
Front --> Utilisateur : Affichage des clients
@enduml
